  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'd like the ability to fully disable the in-game store (or at minimum, opt out of its notifications and badges)\n\nI'm never going to buy anything from it, so the constant barrage of notifications just feels like noise that pushes me towards using the platform less, not more",
